## Step 3 — Architecture & Data Flow

```text
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                   Chrome Extension (Module 1)               │
│               Stereo Int16 PCM @ 48000Hz (2048 samples)     │
└──────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┘
                               │ WebSocket (ws://localhost:8765)
                               ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                 Python VAD Backend (Module 2)                │
│                                                             │
│ 1. Audio Preprocessor (Int16 → Float32, Stereo → Mono, 16k)  │
│ 2. Chunk Accumulator (512-sample / 32ms windowing)          │
│ 3. Silero VAD ONNX Engine (Speech probability evaluation)   │
│ 4. Hysteresis Segmenter (Speech Start / End state machine)  │
└──────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┘
                               │
                ┌──────────────┴──────────────┐
                ▼                             ▼
        [SPEECH DETECTED]             [NON-SPEECH]
      Logs & Speech Segments           Discarded
    (Ready for Module 3 ASR)
```

